{"id":"223292dccac5188a","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-bracket-abstraction.md","title":"CL 括号抽象","display":"df-bracket-abstraction — CL 括号抽象","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-bracket-abstraction","aliases":["56-df-bracket-abstraction"],"display":"df-bracket-abstraction — CL 括号抽象","depends_on":["[[56-df-combinatory-logic]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definition 3.3.6, printed p68","source_ocr_block":"89","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-bracket-abstraction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-bracket-abstraction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bracket-abstraction — CL 括号抽象"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8d1b6ff7d633b15e\" href=\"?note=8d1b6ff7d633b15e\" title=\"56-df-combinatory-logic\">56-df-combinatory-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definition 3.3.6, printed p68"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"89"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(t,u\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in V\">\\(x,y\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\{S,K,I\\}\">\\(c\\in\\{S,K,I\\}\\)</span>。单变量括号抽象的输入域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\times T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(V\\times T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span>，按有限应用树递归。多变量括号抽象的输入域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^{&lt;\\omega}\\times T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(V^{&lt;\\omega}\\times T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in V^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(w\\in V^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon=()\">\\(\\epsilon=()\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span> 是有限序列连接。列表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\">\\((x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\)</span> 作下标时仍写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\">\\([x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[x]x\\coloneqq I,\\qquad[x]y\\coloneqq Ky\\quad(y\\ne x),\\qquad[x]c\\coloneqq Kc,\\qquad[x](tu)\\coloneqq S([x]t)([x]u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[x]x\\coloneqq I,\\qquad[x]y\\coloneqq Ky\\quad(y\\ne x),\\qquad[x]c\\coloneqq Kc,\\qquad[x](tu)\\coloneqq S([x]t)([x]u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[\\epsilon]t\\coloneqq t,\\qquad[(x)\\cdot w]t\\coloneqq[x]([w]t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[\\epsilon]t\\coloneqq t,\\qquad[(x)\\cdot w]t\\coloneqq[x]([w]t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 3.3.6（印刷 p68，OCR 页块89）。输出只含 SKI、应用与未抽象变量；递归严格减小应用子树，因此函数存在唯一。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-combinatory-logic","status":"resolved","id":"8d1b6ff7d633b15e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-combinatory-logic]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"t,u\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\{S,K,I\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V\\times T_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"V^{<\\omega}\\times T_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in V^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon=()","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot","display":false},{"tex":"(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)","display":false},{"tex":"[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]","display":false},{"tex":"[x]x\\coloneqq I,\\qquad[x]y\\coloneqq Ky\\quad(y\\ne x),\\qquad[x]c\\coloneqq Kc,\\qquad[x](tu)\\coloneqq S([x]t)([x]u).","display":true},{"tex":"[\\epsilon]t\\coloneqq t,\\qquad[(x)\\cdot w]t\\coloneqq[x]([w]t).","display":true}],"bytes":1221,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-274","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-bracket-abstraction.md]]"},{"id":"ab87a8c0ba50d579","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $x\\in V$、$t,u\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}$，括号抽象见 [[56-df-bracket-abstraction]]。$t[x:=u]$ 是一阶替换：将 $x$ 送到 $u$ 并固定其他变量，再同态扩张；CL 中没有变量绑定。"}],"outgoing":["8d1b6ff7d633b15e"]}